<div>
<div>
<h3 style=3D"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-varia=
nt-caps: normal; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0,=
 0); background-color: rgb(214, 214, 204);">Don=E2=80=99t RMT - Just Don=E2=
=80=99t</h3>

<div style=3D"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-vari=
ant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-seri=
f; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(214, 214, 20=
4);">Some shady sites and shadier people try to sell in-game currency or it=
ems for real money. The sources for this currency or these items are usuall=
y stolen credit cards or - yep - compromised accounts.</div>

<div style=3D"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-vari=
ant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-seri=
f; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(214, 214, 20=
4);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style=3D"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-vari=
ant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-seri=
f; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(214, 214, 20=
4);">If it comes from a compromised account, it means that someone has lost=
 their hard-earned progress. If they=E2=80=99ve bought and exchanged Premiu=
m currency, it means that we, as the creators of Albion Online, have to dea=
l not just with the loss of payment, but chargeback fees too. Ouch.</div>

<div style=3D"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-vari=
ant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-seri=
f; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(214, 214, 20=
4);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style=3D"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-vari=
ant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-seri=
f; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(214, 214, 20=
4);"><span style=3D"font-weight: 600; font-size: inherit; background: trans=
parent; color: inherit;">Those who buy from these sources hurt the game</sp=
an>. We hate it when people hurt the game - so everyone involved in these t=
ransactions,&nbsp;<span style=3D"font-weight: 600; font-size: inherit; back=
ground: transparent; color: inherit;">including buyers</span>, will be&nbsp=
;<span style=3D"font-weight: 600; font-size: inherit; background: transpare=
nt; color: inherit;">permanently banned</span>.</div>

<div style=3D"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-vari=
ant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-seri=
f; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(214, 214, 20=
4);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style=3D"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-vari=
ant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-seri=
f; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(214, 214, 20=
4);">The only legitimate way to spend money for in-game content is through&=
nbsp;<a href=3D"https://albiononline.com/shop/" style=3D"font-size: 14px;">=
https://albiononline.com/shop/</a>&nbsp;or any of the game clients (Native =
client, Apple, Android, or, Steam). Stick to these places and you=E2=80=99l=
l be just fine.</div>

<div style=3D"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-vari=
ant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-seri=
f; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(214, 214, 20=
